Scoped framemd5 and framehash per-packet hash muxers

The header and packet rows in src/hash/frame-hash-mux.ts follow
libavformat/hashenc.c (framehash_init, framehash_write_header,
framehash_write_packet, the framehash and framemd5 HASH_OPT and
FORMAT_VERSION_OPT defaults) and libavformat/framehash.c
(ff_framehash_write_header). Digests reuse src/hash/digests.ts (see
NOTICE-HASH); packet regrouping reuses src/pcm-framing.ts.
